          "copyright": "Production Copyright, 2024",
          "author": "Clement Clarke Moore",
          "accent": "US English",
          "description": "'Tis the season for classic stories! Clement Clarke Moore's timeless Christmas poem comes gloriously to life as an unabridged immersive soundscape audiobook experience.\n\nThis Root & Twig Sounds production is complete with delightful narration by Phil Dragash, festive original music by Alexander Amadeo and a guest appearance by the Virginian carolers, The Yuletides. Enjoy the Christmas season in a brand new way!\n\n100% Human-Created Content. No generative AI was used for this production.\n\n+++\n\nThis card includes\n\n1. The Night Before Christmas - Intro Credits\n2. The Night Before Christmas\n3. The Night Before Christmas - End Credits\n4. The Suite Before Christmas - Composed by Alexander Amadeo\n5. More from Root & Twig Sounds\n\n+++\n\nA Root & Twig Sounds Production\nWritten by Clement Clarke Moore\nOriginal text published on December 23rd of 1823\nProduced as a Soundscape Audiobook on December 23rd of 2024\nRead and Performed by Phil Dragash\nProduced and Directed by Phil Dragash and A.Y. Barker\nOriginal Music Composed by Alexander Amadeo\nSpecial Thanks to Violet Virginia Mills Barker, Emma Purzycki, the families of Bedford and The Yuletides.\nCover & Pixel Art by Phil Dragash\n\n+++\n\nThe mission of Root and Twig Sounds is to be a beacon of classic stories spectacularly done for the modern ear, helping the world remember its great storytelling heritage. Find more productions by Root & Twig Sounds on the Yoto Card catalog and on our website. \n\nwww.rootandtwigsound.com",
